{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Jambugāmikaputta","html":"<article id='thag1.28'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.28 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.28 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Tatiyavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Three </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Jambugāmikaputtattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Jambugāmikaputta </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Kacci no vatthapasuto, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Aren’t you obsessed with clothes? </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Kacci no bhūsanārato; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Don’t you just love jewelry? </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Kacci sīlamayaṁ gandhaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Is it not you—and no one else—</span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Kiṁ tvaṁ vāyasi netarā pajā”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>who spreads the scent of virtue? </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Jambugāmikaputto thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
